\par\par \b \uc2 DJ WORLD  \highlight22\uc2 FOREX \highlight\uc2 : Yen Rally Cools Amid Japanese  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Fears-2-\b0\par\par\uc2 By Javier E. David Of DOW JONES NEWSWIRES   \par \uc2 488 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 18 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2011\par 00:04\par \uc2 Dow Jones Chinese Financial Wire\par \uc2 DJCFWE\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright (c) 2011, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 NEW YORK (Dow Jones)--The yen fell from a record high against the dollar Thursday, as demand for the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the wake of Japan's nuclear crisis was temporarily squelched by fears that officials may sell yen to curb its strength.\par \par \uc2 In a seemingly counterintuitive move, demand for the yen has surged as Japan's natural disaster has rapidly transformed into a nuclear crisis that has roiled markets worldwide. On Thursday, the yen's broad strength hammered the dollar to a historical low at Y76.25, and sent the euro to its lowest level since September at Y106.50.\par \par \uc2 In the last week alone, the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  has appreciated by more than 8% amid speculation that Japanese institutions were selling foreign assets in order to send money back to the disaster-stricken country. On Thursday, those flows gave way to concerns that \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  might \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 --perhaps with the help of the world's largest industrialized nations.\par \par \uc2 Analysts, however, are sharply divided on the nature of the investment flows behind the surging yen. While most acknowledge that Japanese repatriation is supporting the yen, they add that widespread risk aversion was leading some investors to unwind 'carry trades' that use the low-yielding Japanese \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to fund high-return, riskier positions elsewhere.\par \par \uc2 'There will be some repatriation but this sort of trade is overblown and ridiculous,' said Jessica Hoversen, fixed income and \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  analyst at \uc2 MF Global\uc2  in Chicago.\par \par \uc2 'If [\b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's nuclear crisis] stabilizes and we see coordinated \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , dollar/yen will stabilize and start to move higher,' she said, adding that Japan's woeful economic fundamentals bode for a weaker \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Japan's export-reliant economy will need a weak yen to help offset the effects of the disaster that struck last week. Accordingly, market participants are on high alert for yen-selling \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Traders were awaiting the outcome of a teleconference among Group of Seven finance ministers Thursday for indications about Japan's intentions in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets.\par \par \uc2 Indeed, a person familiar with the \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  told Dow Jones Newswires that Japanese authorities were 'prepared for battle' against emboldened traders determined to buy yen.\par \par \uc2 Analysts were struck by the swiftness of the yen's rise, which pushed the dollar down dramatically after Wednesday's trading session had drawn to a close. Once the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  pair broke below its 1995 low around Y79.75, sell orders appeared to cascade.\par \par \uc2 'It was a stop-loss fest,' quipped John McCarthy, managing director of \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  at ING Capital Markets in New York. But he added the move wasn't entirely unprecedented, as dramatic moves happen once or twice a year 'in this twilight zone.' -By Javier E. David, Dow Jones Newswires; 212-416-4564; javier.david@dowjones.com\par \par \uc2 -0-\par \par \uc2 Copyright (c) 2011 \uc2 Dow Jones & Company, Inc\uc2 . \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJCFWE0020110318e73h00mat\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
