stor sentiment continues to dissipate. (kosaku.narioka@dowjones.com) [ 03-17-11 0306ET ]\par \par \uc2 4022   \par \par \uc2 Dokument CM00000020110317e73h0004h\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
